{
  "name": "Dompetku – Telegram Bot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 Dompetku — Telegram Bot\n\nn8n is only a thin **relay**: all logic (parsing, OCR, categories, reports, buttons) lives in the Dompetku web app (`POST /api/public/n8n/bot`), so it is tested and easy to maintain.\n\n**Required n8n env:** `FINTRACK_URL`, `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`, `TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS` (+ `N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=false`)\n**Optional:** `TELEGRAM_BOT_USERNAME` (without @) for exact mention matching in groups\n**Credentials:** Telegram API (trigger) & Header Auth — Name `x-api-key`, Value = the web app's `N8N_API_KEY`. Replace every `REPLACE_ME` credential.\n\n🔒 Chats outside the allow-list are silently ignored. Successful executions are not saved (privacy + disk).\nGuide: docs/N8N.md",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 760,
        "color": "6"
      },
      "id": "40f81ded-38c8-4fba-a9ca-df15802c4f73",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message",
          "callback_query"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {
          "download": true,
          "imageSize": "extraLarge"
        }
      },
      "id": "c312a7fd-416b-4e43-893a-60fcabe153ed",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "10055bdc-78e1-4a66-b9dd-d72a17ceae80",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Telegram Dompetku Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normalisasi update Telegram + allow-list (fail-closed: daftar kosong = tolak semua).\nconst allowed = String($env.TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS || '').split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean);\nconst MAX_IMAGE_BYTES = 3_200_000; // base64 ≈ 4,3 MB < batas body Vercel 4,5 MB\nconst botUser = String($env.TELEGRAM_BOT_USERNAME || '').replace(/^@/, '') || null; // opsional: cocokkan mention persis\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst out = [];\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < items.length; i++) {\n  const u = items[i].json;\n  const cb = u.callback_query;\n  const msg = cb ? cb.message : u.message;\n  const chatId = String(msg?.chat?.id ?? cb?.from?.id ?? '');\n  const base = {\n    update_id: u.update_id,\n    chat_id: chatId,\n    message_id: msg?.message_id ?? null,\n    callback_id: cb?.id ?? null,\n  };\n  const chatType = msg?.chat?.type ?? null; // private | group | supergroup | channel\n  const isGroup = chatType === 'group' || chatType === 'supergroup';\n  const replyToBot = !!msg?.reply_to_message?.from?.is_bot && (!botUser || msg.reply_to_message.from.username?.toLowerCase() === botUser.toLowerCase());\n  const ctx = { chat_type: chatType, reply_to_bot: replyToBot, bot_username: botUser };\n\n  if (!chatId || !allowed.includes(chatId)) { out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'blocked' } }); continue; }\n\n  if (cb) {\n    out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'callback', payload: { update_id: u.update_id, chat_id: chatId, callback_data: String(cb.data || '').slice(0, 64), ...ctx } } });\n    continue;\n  }\n\n  // Grup: hanya tanggapi /perintah, mention @username, atau balasan ke bot; sisanya diabaikan diam-diam.\n  if (isGroup) {\n    const t = String(msg?.text ?? msg?.caption ?? '');\n    if (!(t.startsWith('/') || /@\\w+/.test(t) || replyToBot)) { out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'blocked' } }); continue; }\n  }\n\n  const isImageDoc = !!msg?.document && /^image\\/(jpeg|png|webp)$/.test(msg.document.mime_type || '');\n  if (msg?.photo || isImageDoc) {\n    const bin = items[i].binary?.data;\n    if (!bin) { out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'reply', reply: '⚠️ Foto gagal diunduh, coba kirim ulang.' } }); continue; }\n    const buf = await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(i, 'data');\n    if (buf.length > MAX_IMAGE_BYTES) {\n      out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'reply', reply: '⚠️ Gambar terlalu besar (maks ±3 MB). Kirim sebagai foto biasa, bukan file.' } });\n      continue;\n    }\n    const mime = isImageDoc ? msg.document.mime_type : 'image/jpeg'; // foto Telegram selalu JPEG; server wajib menerima mime_type\n    out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'image', payload: { update_id: u.update_id, chat_id: chatId, text: msg.caption ?? null, image_base64: buf.toString('base64'), mime_type: mime, ...ctx } } });\n    continue;\n  }\n\n  const text = msg?.text ?? null;\n  if (text) {\n    out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'text', payload: { update_id: u.update_id, chat_id: chatId, text: text.slice(0, 2000), ...ctx } } });\n    continue;\n  }\n\n  if (isGroup) { out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'blocked' } }); continue; }\n  out.push({ json: { ...base, type: 'reply', reply: '🙏 Bot ini menerima teks dan foto struk. Ketik /help untuk bantuan.' } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
