    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Flow\n1. **Text** `kopi 25rb` → parser without AI → preview + buttons ✅❌🏷🏦🔁\n2. **Receipt photo** → OCR (AI vision) → preview\n3. **/command** → reports / balances / paylater / subscriptions (0 AI tokens)\n4. **Button** → `callback_data` forwarded → the preview message is *edited*\n\nRetries are safe: drafts & saves are idempotent (`update_id` / `draft:<id>`).\nAPI error → red (error) output → the user still gets a ⚠️ message.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 700,
        "color": "4"
      },
